on":1,"reason":null,"unit_id":"agent:project.symbol-reference-completeness","usage":{"input_tokens":208254,"output_tokens":6760,"requests":9}}],"version":1},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.7,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add `_commands/{composer,composer_edit,leaf,link_revert,unlink}.py` to the step-4 flat-path consumer inventory (each builds `tracker / <id>` directly) so they resolve ticket dirs through the layout helper.","cohort":["G1G2"],"criteria":["G1G2"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.3,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["`src/rebar/_commands/composer.py:185,187`: `if not (tracker / resolved).is_dir(): ... pdir = tracker / resolved`","`src/rebar/_commands/composer_edit.py:104,137,164,178`: `reduce_ticket(str(tracker / resolved))` / `(tracker / new_parent)`","`src/rebar/_commands/leaf.py:207`: `ticket_dir = tracker / resolved`","`src/rebar/_commands/link_revert.py:270`: `ticket_dir = tracker / resolved` then walks its event files","`src/rebar/_commands/unlink.py:124,127,175,179`: `(tracker / tid).is_dir()`, `_get_link_info(tracker / source_id, ...)`","Step 4 frames the list as the exhaustive 'Required inventory' but none of composer/composer_edit/leaf/link_revert/unlink appear in it (close_precheck, _seam, delete, transition, claim, txn, etc. ARE listed)."],"finding":"Step 4's 'Required inventory' of flat ticket-path consumers omits several command modules that construct `tracker/<id>` directly and would resolve to the wrong (flat) path after the sharded migration.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f4830053bf601a7bf","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Implementation Plan step 4 (Required inventory)","norm_id":"n9afd86c0f8cd20d3","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["After ensure `ticket-layout-shards` migrates a store, `ticket edit`/composer, `leaf`, `link revert`, and `unlink` build `tracker/<id>` and hit a now-missing flat dir, raising not-found or ghost errors on m